{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Basilisk Paw is a ",["l","饰品","trinket"]," item obtainable after claiming ",["l","精通山洞#Masteries","Combat Mastery"],". It can be obtained by slaying ",["l","怪物","monsters"]," or breaking ",["l","矿井#Crates and Barrels","crates and barrels"]," in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],", ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],", or ",["l","采石场矿井","Quarry Mine"],". Drop chances from both methods are affected by ",["l","运气#Daily Luck","daily luck"]," and ",["l","运气#Luck Buffs","luck buffs"],", among other factors. The ",["l","窃贼戒指","Burglar's Ring"]," and ",["l","怪物图鉴","Monster Compendium"]," do not impact the chance to obtain it from monsters. There is also a ≈0.6% chance to obtain a Basilisk Paw from a ",["l","骷髅洞穴#Treasure Rooms","treasure chest"]," in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],"."]],["p",["While the Basilisk Paw is equipped in the trinket slot, the player is completely immune to all ",["l","效果","debuffs"]," caused by enemies (e.g., Slimed or Jinxed). It does not prevent the self-inflicted Tipsy debuff. The trinket has the same effect as the ",["l","效果#Squid Ink Ravioli","Squid Ink Ravioli buff"],"."]],["p",["The Basilisk Paw cannot be re-forged on an ",["l","铁砧","Anvil"],"."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",